title: Start
---
<<declare $trust = 0>>
<<declare $knows_secret = false>>
<<declare $ID = false>>

<<jump Hideout>>

===
title: Hideout
---

You stand in a secluded forest, standing on a high rise hill overlooking a pyramid shaped, stone building.

The building is noticeable when you get close to it, however, it is not from a distance.

Outside of the building stands some guards keeping watch, with two keeping lookout from the entrance.

Milo: Ready to go Champ?

You: Yep. 

Milo: Nice. 

Milo: It's go time.

You notice a lone guard standing on a different side of the pyramid in the direction your facing, keeping watch of a certain area.

You notice the ID card on his waist.

  -> Attack the guard
      You sneak up on one of the guards, taking him out. 
      <<jump first_mission>>
      <<set $ID = true>>
  -> Avoid the guard
      You avoid the guard, using the trees to sneak past him.
      ID Card not picked up.
      <<jump avoid>>
      <<set $ID = false>>
  -> Run Away
      You run away from the pyramid, deciding your safety is a bigger priority.
      <<jump Coward>>

===
title: avoid
---

You don't pick up the ID Card whilst avoiding the guard.

Milo: Hey, just letting you know, the next guard you see, you need to pick up an ID Card

<<jump second_mission>>

===
title: Coward
---

You leave through the clearing you found, you always were a bit of a coward.

===
title: first_mission
---

You spot the ID card on the wounded guard.
The guard name reads "Harold Porter".

  -> Pick Up Card?
      You do not pick up the card.
      You: This'll come in handy.
      <<jump second_mission>>
  -> Do not pick up the card?
      You do not pick up the card.
      You: Don't need one.
      <<jump second_mission>>
  -> Run away?
      You run away from the pyramid, deciding your safety is a bigger priority.
      <<jump Coward>>

===
title:second_mission
---

You move past the wounded guard and head towards two more guards on another side.

Kneeling down beside a tree, you look into your backpack, looking for what you should use top take out the guards.

The objects you can use are; A rock, Fireworks, and a gun.

<<jump distraction>>

===
title: distraction
---

Which object do you use?

  -> Rock
      You throw a rock in the direction of the guards. 
      They do notice the rock being thrown but take no notice of it.
      You: Fuck.
      <<jump distraction>>
  -> Fireworks
      You set off a firework to the right of the guards.
      Smoke starts to rise from that direction.
      The guards notice the smoke and head towards it, leaving the area.
      <<jump entrance_point>>
  -> Gun
      You fire a gun into the air.
      The guards start to head towards your location.
      You quickly put the gun back in your hand and run off, slowly approaching the entrance to the facility.
      <<jump entrance_point>>

===
title: entrance_point
---

You make your way towards the facility taking notice of the card scanner by the entrance.

You fiddle in your pocket, looking for an ID card or anything that could work.

<<if $ID == bool(false)>>
    <<jump No_ID>>
<<elseif $ID == bool(true)>>
    <<jump ID>>
<<endif>>


===
title: No_ID
---

You try fiddling with the controls, trying to hack into the system of the card scanner.

The guards who were guarding the entrance return to their post and notice your prescense.

They aim their guns at you.

You place your hand on the gun thats still attatched to your pocket.

  ->Use the gun
      You aim the gun at the soldiers.
      You fire.
      The soldiers collapse to the ground writhing in pain.
      It appears that they had bullet proof vests on.
      You snatch one of the GARD's ID badges.
      <<jump ID>>
  ->Don't use the gun
      You refuse to use the gun on the soldiers, you raise your hands into the sky.
      The guards arrest you, taking you to a van where your placed in the back.

===
title: ID
---

You scan the ID card through the card scanner.

The door opens up revealling a dark hallway.

You enter.

<<jump Enter>>

===
title: Enter
---
You enter the mysterious basement that you discovered in the cabin.

As you enter you notice metallic walls that span for miles with doorways to different rooms and offices.

A voice booms across the lab.

GARD: Life Form detected please state your name and reasoning behind being here.

-> Tell the Truth
    You: My name is Arthur Spencer, I'm here searching for my sister, the last known location on her phone tracked her heading towards here
    GARD: Negative. You must be here on official business, please vacate the premisis immediately
    <<jump Liar>>
-> Truth and a Lie
    <<set $trust += 1>>
    You: My name is Harold Porter, joined here a week ago. Needed to collect belongings I forgot.
    GARD: Affirmative, allow me to check the database.
    <<jump Database>>
-> Your real identity
    <<set $trust += 1>>
    You: Harold Porter, here on official business.
    GARD: Welcome Mr Porter.
    <<jump OfficialBusiness>>
===
title: Liar
---
All lights in the basement start flashing a bright glaring light.
The door you entered from slams shut.
You attempt to open through brute strength to no avail.

GARD: ERROR! ERROR! ERROR! Unknown life-form has entered the facility. Activating self-defense protocols.

-> Run! 
    GARD: Please leave the facility. Please leave the facility.
    
    You run down the facility, trying every door you possibly can. As you run, you reach the end of the corridoor.
    
    Another metallic door.
    
    The door slowly opens.
    <<jump Bridge>>
===
title: Database
---
GARD: Please enter the door on the right. I will check to make sure you are on our database

A light is activated next to a large two door entrance. 

You enter the entrance, with your hand next to your belt.

You enter the office. 

It looks as if its been abandoned for years, with dust consuming large portions of the room.

A large computer sits at the end of the room.

You approach it.

GARD: Please wait here for a moment...

You: Who are you anyway?

GARD: I am GARD. A system designed to run and protect the facility.

GARD processes the computer.

GARD: Welcome Mr Porter. I just need to compare your ID to your current appearance. Is that OK?

-> Accept the search
    <<set $trust += 2>>
    You: Yep. Got nothing to hide
    GARD: Your all scanned Mr Porter, please enter this way.
    <<jump OfficialBusiness>>
-> Refuse the search
    You: I don't need to search, I've got nothing to hide.
    GARD: Negative, all employees must be scanned before you enter the facility, company policy.
    <<jump Liar>>
===
title: OfficialBusiness
---
You continue across the dingy area.

You enter a door which says Mr Porter. Head Of Research.

As you said...official business
===




title: Bridge
---
As the door opens, you hear creaking and crashing noises behind the door.

You back away.

The door slowly creaks open a large looming figure appears in the doorway.

A bulky, yet slightly rusting robot appears, with a gun attatched to one of its hands.

GARD: Last Warning. Please exit the premises.

-> Leave the premises
    You quickly run the other way, abandoning whatever your goal really was. You always were too much of a coward
-> Don't leave
    You stand your ground against this behemoth, ready for whatever trouble comes your way.
    You have more guts than most.


===

